# Gemini API key for the AI layer.
#
# THIS SHIPS IN THE STATIC BUNDLE. It is not a secret and cannot be one in a
# client-only app. Protect it in the Google Cloud console instead:
#   1. Application restriction -> HTTP referrers -> https://myvaravuselavu.web.app/*
#   2. API restriction -> Generative Language API only
#   3. Leave billing DISABLED on the project — that cap is the real backstop
# Leave unset to build with the AI layer inert; the app works exactly as before.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
